#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to preview blog posts locally using the Roq-based dev server: start the site with serve-noguides.sh for fast iteration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: name
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "building-blog"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building Blog Posts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Platforms"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This workflow is supported on Linux, macOS, and Windows through WSL2.\n"
"Java 21+ and Maven (or the included `./mvnw` wrapper) are required.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the full preview pipeline in one command — starts the dev server, detects which\n"
"posts you changed, and opens the right URLs in your browser:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "just blog-preview\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or directly:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "bash blog-preview.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "To just start the dev server without the auto-open behaviour:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "./serve-noguides.sh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then browse to [http://localhost:8080/blog/](http://localhost:8080/blog/).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:38
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "仕組み"

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The site is built with [Quarkus Roq](https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-roq/dev/index.html),\n"
"a Quarkus-based static site generator. Running `mvn quarkus:dev` starts a live-reload\n"
"dev server — edits to content files are picked up automatically without a server restart.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`blog-preview.sh` starts the dev server in the background, waits for it to be ready,\n"
"then detects recently changed posts and opens the right URLs in your browser before\n"
"bringing the server to the foreground. Press Ctrl-C to stop.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Detect and Open"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "The script auto-detects what you were working on and opens the right page:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Changed posts | Preview URLs |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| 1 post | `/blog/` (listing) + `/blog/<slug>/` (deep-link) |\n"
"| 2–4 posts | `/blog/` (listing) + a tab for each post |\n"
"| 5+ posts | `/blog/` (listing only), unless git narrows it |\n"
"| No changes | `/blog/` (listing only) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "The slug is derived from the filename: strip the `YYYY-MM-DD-` prefix and the file extension.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Change detection uses a `.blog-preview-last-run` timestamp file on repeat runs, and\n"
"falls back to `git diff`/`git log` on first run. Delete `.blog-preview-last-run` to reset.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Script | Profile | What it includes |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `./serve.sh` | (default) | Full site with all guides |\n"
"| `./serve-noguides.sh` | `noguides` | Site without guides (fast) |\n"
"| `./serve-only-latest-guides.sh` | `only-latest-guides` | Site with latest + main guides |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "For blog-only work, `serve-noguides.sh` is the fastest option.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Blog Post File Conventions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Location: `content/posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.adoc` (or `.asciidoc`, `.md`)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Front matter fields: `layout: post`, `title`, `date`, `tags`, `synopsis`, `author`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "`author` must match a key in `_data/authors.yaml`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tags: lowercase, space-separated — e.g. `tags: extension kafka`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images: store in `public/assets/images/posts/<slug>/`, reference with `:imagesdir: /assets/images/posts/<slug>`\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Future-Dated Posts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Posts with a `date` value in the future are served normally by the local dev server.\n"
"No special flag or workaround is needed — just run `./serve-noguides.sh` and the post will appear.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "Iteration Loop"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit content/posts/YYYY-MM-DD-slug.adoc → save → Roq rebuilds → browser refreshes\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quarkus dev mode watches for file changes and triggers an incremental rebuild automatically.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "トラブルシューティング"

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Port 8080 already in use** — Another process is occupying the default port.\n"
"Pass a different port: `./serve-noguides.sh -Dquarkus.http.port=8081`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Changes not appearing** — Quarkus dev mode watches source files. If a change is not picked\n"
"up, press `s` in the terminal running the dev server to force a restart, or stop and re-run\n"
"`./serve-noguides.sh`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Post not appearing** — Check that the file is in `content/posts/` with the correct\n"
"`YYYY-MM-DD-slug.adoc` naming and that the front matter `layout: post` and `author` fields\n"
"are present and valid.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: .agents/skills/building-blog/SKILL.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Slow first start** — The first run downloads Maven dependencies. Subsequent starts are fast.\n"
msgstr ""
